/bin/
/dist/
# Local SBOM cache and vulnerability database of `mise run dev`.
/.cache/
node_modules/
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Personal, machine-local settings (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR, tokens, extra tools).
mise.local.toml
.mise.local.toml

# The agent sandbox profile and the agent's own configuration. Both describe one machine
# rather than the service: which paths a session may write, where its credentials are kept,
# which hooks run locally. A profile is passed to `mise run claude` by path, so nothing in
# this repository needs them to exist — see CONTRIBUTING.md.
.nono/
.claude/

# Measurements, reports and notes from a real installation. These name clusters, namespaces,
# workloads and the versions they run, which the hard rule in CLAUDE.md keeps out of this
# repository. The documents here cite their *findings* in neutral form; the raw record of
# where a number came from stays local.
notes/
feedback.md
feedback-*.md

# Scanner data that must never be committed.
*.sbom.json
sboms/
grype-db/

.DS_Store

# Stray binaries from `go build ./tools/<name>`, which writes into the current directory.
# The tasks use `go run`, so these only appear by hand — and one was nearly committed.
/vulnguard
/identityguard
/licenseguard
